  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educate and train Board members of Egyptian companies to fulfill their legal responsibilities and to comply with corporate and securities legislation.  Provide accreditation of company directors. 01/07/03.  Task Team Leader changed from Julia Devlin to John Speakman, effective December 1, 2002. 02/24/04.  Task Team Leader changed from John Speakman to Christian Schmidt, effective January 1, 2004. 10/04/2004.  Task Team Leader changed from Christian Schmidt to Sahr Nasr effective October 1, 2004. 09/27/05.  The IDF Grant TF051020 was signed on September 16, 2003 for $247,000.  To date, $70,000 has been disbursed leaving a balance of $177,000.  The closing date of the IDF Grant is December 30, 2006. 10/02/06. Responsible Cost Center changed from MNSIF (7023) to MNSED (7019) effective October 1, 2006.</narrative>
  </description>
